    <summary>Provides information about a change to the default media key event session.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>This .NET event data contains the arguments supplied to <see cref="M:Android.Media.Session.MediaSessionManager.IOnMediaKeyEventSessionChangedListener.OnMediaKeyEventSessionChanged(System.String,Android.Media.Session.MediaSession.Token)" />. The session is the default target for media key events when no target is specified.</para>
      <para>The callback contract is defined in the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/refs/tags/android-16.0.0_r1/media/java/android/media/session/MediaSessionManager.java">Android source</a></format>. The constructor and properties follow the .NET <format type="text/html"><a href="https://github.com/dotnet/java-interop/blob/92b5d471f1e0f6164fc332b1f661b472f5cf3aad/tools/generator/SourceWriters/InterfaceEventArgsClass.cs">event data generator</a></format>.</para>
